124
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:11,140
This radio system can transmit on hundreds of different radio frequencies,

125
00:10:11,141 --> 00:10:14,140
so each tower can handle hundreds of calls at once,

126
00:10:14,141 --> 00:10:17,140
without one call interfering with another.

127
00:10:17,141 --> 00:10:24,380
The tower connects your call to a regular landline phone system.

128
00:10:24,381 --> 00:10:28,980
This system routes your call to a landline phone or to a tower closest to the cell phone

129
00:10:28,981 --> 00:10:32,500
