182
00:15:00,361 --> 00:15:04,040
Digital cameras have come so far in just a handful of years.

183
00:15:04,041 --> 00:15:07,580
Here's an early one. This is one of the very first digital cameras that was popular.

184
00:15:07,581 --> 00:15:11,080
