00:18:06,481 --> 00:18:10,020
Video On Demand starts at your home TV cable

225
00:18:10,021 --> 00:18:10,721
box.

226
00:18:10,722 --> 00:18:18,260
When you request a movie, a signal travels through high-speed fiber optic cable lines

227
00:18:18,261 --> 00:18:23,260
to a video server, which acts as a warehouse of the digitally stored movies and programs.

228
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:32,100
In seconds, the server begins sending a compressed digital stream to your home cable box,

229
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:36,300
