234
00:18:57,620 --> 00:19:00,600
We no longer have to wait for the radio to play our favorite song.

235
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:07,160
An electronic industry phenomenon is the portable digital music player.

236
00:19:07,161 --> 00:19:12,340
It uses a system that compresses a CD song by a factor of 10

237
00:19:12,341 --> 00:19:15,040
